<title>USA: WFI insiders buy about 650,000 shares.</title>
<headline>WFI insiders buy about 650,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WAYNE, Ind. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>WFI Industries Ltd said Monday a group of insiders purchased about 650,000 shares of WFI stock at a price of US$0.805 or C$1.10 per share.</p>
<p>The majority of buyers were new board members, elected at a May 7, 1996 meeting, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
